ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/5e032f0cb0edaa69b4a565a66196d424.poster.avif?t=1640012685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/5e032f0cb0edaa69b4a565a66196d424.webm?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/5e032f0cb0edaa69b4a565a66196d424.mp4?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>70 different patches to combine and discover historical facts and important moments of the interplanetary missions<br></li><li>Complete over 30 interplanetary exploration missions<br></li><li>Drag and drop the patches in the right places and complete the mission;<br></li><li>Earn exclusive stamps;<br></li><li>Increase your knowledge of the history of astronomy;<br></li><li>The beginning of space stations </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/46ea1e3048b32a0591d925381f8908b0.poster.avif?t=1640012685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/46ea1e3048b32a0591d925381f8908b0.webm?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/46ea1e3048b32a0591d925381f8908b0.mp4?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Great soundtrack. Original sound effects designed exclusively for the best experience.<br><br>Test your knowledge of space exploration and the achievements that are part of the history of the world, with the help of Laika, the first space astronaut puppy.<br><br><i>For all lovers of trivia and puzzle games and who admire the stars!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1640012685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676570/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1640012685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
